{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Better Mart \u2013 Build and Manage Your Dream Supermarket!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Better Mart</strong>, a dynamic management game, in 1st and 3rd person, where you create, customize, and grow the <strong>ultimate supermarket</strong>! Combining <strong>fun and strategy</strong>, this game gives you complete freedom to design a <strong>unique store</strong>, attract customers, and maximize your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/HighresScreenshot00039.png?t=1744563890\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Complete and Addictive Management Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Better Mart</strong>, you have full control over every aspect of your supermarket. Choose the layout of your aisles, arrange products efficiently, and optimize customer flow to ensure a smooth and enjoyable shopping experience. Keep your shelves stocked, monitor market trends, and adjust your prices to outsmart the competition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What Awaits You in Better Mart:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Build and customize your supermarket</strong> \u2013 Design the aisles, set up different areas, and create a welcoming environment for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Manage supply and inventory</strong> \u2013 Keep track of stock levels, order new products, and adjust prices based on market trends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow your business</strong> \u2013 Hire and train staff, improve checkout efficiency, and invest in modern equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unlock new sections</strong> \u2013 Add a bakery, fresh produce section, electronics department, and much more to expand your offerings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enhance customer experience</strong> \u2013 Study customer behavior, optimize their shopping journey, and ensure their satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Expand your empire</strong> \u2013 Start with a small grocery store and transform it into a thriving supermarket chain while overcoming market challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/Nouveau_GIF_Page_Steam.gif?t=1744563890\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are You Ready for the Challenge?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you dream of building a retail empire and tackling the challenges of real entrepreneurship, <strong>Better Mart</strong> is the game for you. Manage your inventory, oversee your staff, optimize customer experience, and turn your store into a true success story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take charge and build the ultimate supermarket today!</strong> \ud83d\ude80</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/extras/Nouveau_GIF_Page_Steam_2.gif?t=1744563890\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498270?t=1744563890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744563890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/51f864788163d2efea10337735d9499ecfa615be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744563890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498270/51f864788163d2efea10337735d9499ecfa615be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744563890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":